<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-FRENCHMAN BROCHARD WINS TOUR DE FRANCE NINTH STAGE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-FRENCHMAN BROCHARD WINS TOUR DE FRANCE NINTH STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>LOUDENVIELLE, France 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frenchman Laurent Brochard won the 182-km ninth stage of the Tour de France from Pau to Loudenvielle on Monday.  </p>
<p>Frenchman Cedric Vasseur retained the overall leader's yellow jersey.</p>
</text>
